14:57.123 --> 14:57.923
Is there anything else?

14:57.923 --> 14:58.157
Is there anything else?

14:58.157 --> 15:00.026
Could you do something about these, too?

15:00.026 --> 15:01.927
What? But they're cute!

15:01.927 --> 15:02.052
What? But they're cute!

15:04.497 --> 15:10.266
Oh, I should've gotten an honorable
retirement last year...

15:10.403 --> 15:11.103
Huh?

15:11.103 --> 15:11.237
Huh?

15:11.237 --> 15:13.239
Hey, what happened to Serizawa?

15:13.239 --> 15:14.473
I can't hold it any more!

15:17.810 --> 15:18.744
Noooool!

15:18.744 --> 15:20.413
Oh my god!

15:20.413 --> 15:22.177
I'll go get some water!

15:22.782 --> 15:26.452
Upako! Upako! Hang in there!

15:26.452 --> 15:27.987
Hey, more importantly,
what happened to Serizawa?

15:27.987 --> 15:31.223
Hey, somebody do something about
this frickin' kangaroo.

15:31.223 --> 15:31.757
Hey, the penguin got out!

15:31.757 --> 15:33.392
Hey, the penguin got out!

15:33.392 --> 15:34.985
I'll go get some water!

15:35.928 --> 15:36.724
Hey!

15:36.829 --> 15:39.699
Hang in there! Upako!

15:39.699 --> 15:42.600
She can make it! She can make it with her guts!

15:43.602 --> 15:46.537
Oh well, no matter...

15:50.676 --> 15:53.546
Um, can you say that again?

15:53.546 --> 15:56.148
I am Roboko.

15:56.148 --> 16:01.253
The most advanced robot
developed by NASA. Piko, piko.

16:01.253 --> 16:03.089
Whoa! She said NASA! That's awesome!

16:03.089 --> 16:03.322
Whoa! She said NASA! That's awesome!

16:03.322 --> 16:05.491
All right, Roboko, I got it.

16:05.491 --> 16:06.992
What are you doing here anyway?

16:06.992 --> 16:07.259
What are you doing here anyway?

16:07.259 --> 16:14.233
The U.S. Department of Defense has sent me to
investigate the little kid teacher. Piko, piko.

16:14.233 --> 16:15.901
Yeah, sure.

16:15.901 --> 16:18.838
Consider me a transfer student. Piko.

16:18.838 --> 16:23.442
Mahoho! I have a robot
for a classmate! I'm excited!

16:23.442 --> 16:26.078
It doesn't take much to please you, does it?

16:26.078 --> 16:28.914
She's getting all the attention... Must be nice...

16:28.914 --> 16:30.216
I agree...

16:30.216 --> 16:35.052
Whatever. Just go back to your seats!
We'll start homeroom.

16:35.588 --> 16:37.857
Not so fast! Piko!

16:37.857 --> 16:38.724
Huh?

16:38.724 --> 16:42.394
Little Kid Teacher, I'm going to
investigate your power!

16:42.394 --> 16:43.729
I challenge you! Ha!

16:43.729 --> 16:43.996
I challenge you! Ha!

16:43.996 --> 16:46.232
Come on, give me a break.

16:47.733 --> 16:48.234
Don't ignore me.

16:48.234 --> 16:48.734
Don't ignore me.

16:48.734 --> 16:52.796
Now, this is a man-to-man battle,
with our pride on the line!

16:53.472 --> 16:54.607
We're girls.

16:54.607 --> 16:56.200
D'oh!

16:58.144 --> 17:00.179
When my life finishes burning,

17:00.179 --> 17:02.414
all that will be left is pure white dust...

17:02.414 --> 17:04.348
Pi... ko... ko...

17:11.323 --> 17:14.193
Somebody get this thing out of here!

17:14.193 --> 17:17.595
What she's doing is nothing but
interfering with my class!

17:17.930 --> 17:19.523
Becky...

17:20.533 --> 17:24.333
You! How dare you make my Becky cry?
This is unforgivable!

17:28.607 --> 17:31.777
Piko, piko, friend, friend.

17:31.777 --> 17:32.411
Rei, she's a human!

17:32.411 --> 17:33.412
Rei, she's a human!

17:33.412 --> 17:36.211
That NASA thing was phony! She fooled us!

17:36.482 --> 17:37.917
You idiot...

17:37.917 --> 17:40.219
Yes, this is Roboko.

17:40.219 --> 17:42.555
What? The President is in big trouble?!

17:42.555 --> 17:45.124
Roger! I'll return immediately! Piko!

17:45.124 --> 17:45.858
Wait!

17:45.858 --> 17:45.958
Wait!

17:45.958 --> 17:46.692
Akane Serizawa from 1-B!

17:46.692 --> 17:47.124
Akane Serizawa from 1-B!

17:49.161 --> 17:51.130
We won't let you get away.

17:51.130 --> 17:55.134
We're still in the middle of class, Roboko.

17:55.134 --> 17:56.158
Maho, maho, maho.

17:57.203 --> 17:58.504
Let me go!

17:58.504 --> 18:01.207
Don't think you can just get out of here
after making Becky cry!

18:01.207 --> 18:02.174
No!

18:04.510 --> 18:07.847
Well then, by homeroom class next week

18:07.847 --> 18:11.650
I want you to form small groups
for the camping class next month.

18:14.353 --> 18:16.388
See, it's not moving.

18:16.388 --> 18:19.585
What are you talking about? She IS moving!

18:19.892 --> 18:21.860
Upako! Hey!

18:24.930 --> 18:28.093
Seriously, I should've retired last year...

18:28.534 --> 18:29.635
All right, why don't we decide the groups
for the camping class by lot?

18:29.635 --> 18:32.638
All right, why don't we decide the groups
for the camping class by lot?

18:32.938 --> 18:34.573
I know it's a pain but...

18:34.573 --> 18:34.607
I know it's a pain but...

18:34.607 --> 18:35.574
Glance!

18:35.574 --> 18:35.608
Glance!

18:35.608 --> 18:37.476
Kurumi Momose!

18:38.577 --> 18:39.578
You make the lots.

18:39.578 --> 18:39.601
You make the lots.

18:40.846 --> 18:41.814
Okay...

18:41.814 --> 18:43.782
Four people per group, okay?

18:43.782 --> 18:44.783
Yes!

18:44.783 --> 18:48.583
Thanks to all the problems you've caused,
I remember your name now!

18:49.822 --> 18:51.950
Becky...

18:52.458 --> 18:53.425
Please take care of that for me, okay?

18:53.425 --> 18:54.859
I'll do my best!

18:56.128 --> 18:57.763
E-Excuse me...

18:57.763 --> 19:01.233
Yeah? What's up, Roboko?
Do you have to go the bathroom?

19:01.233 --> 19:02.902
Y-Yes, piko.

19:02.902 --> 19:06.171
I see, I didn't know robots went to the bathroom.

19:06.171 --> 19:12.244
Well, err, um... To tell you the truth, I am...

19:12.244 --> 19:14.813
If you pretend, keep it up until the end.

19:14.813 --> 19:16.178
You're in the drama club, right?

19:17.917 --> 19:20.853
Be a robot and just say it! Right, Becky?

19:20.853 --> 19:23.413
Huh? I guess.

19:26.692 --> 19:30.729
Warning! At this rate,
the environment will be polluted!

19:30.729 --> 19:33.994
Life on the Earth will be destroyed!

19:34.166 --> 19:34.967
This is not good!

19:34.967 --> 19:36.502
Himeko, untie the rope!

19:36.502 --> 19:38.027
What?! I don't want to!

19:40.439 --> 19:43.465
Roboko, you're at the limit of the year!

19:43.943 --> 19:45.536
Roboko!

19:48.080 --> 19:49.782
Crap! We used too much gunpowder!

19:49.782 --> 19:51.580
Yasuda!

19:56.956 --> 19:58.947
Serizawa...

20:04.463 --> 20:06.799
I'm glad Kurumi feels better now.

20:06.799 --> 20:07.199
I'm glad Kurumi feels better now.

20:07.199 --> 20:08.834
Becky isn't bad at all.

20:08.834 --> 20:11.837
Well, she WAS the one who created
the problem to begin with.

20:11.837 --> 20:15.140
Anyway, it's all good!
It "served two purposes," didn't it?

20:15.140 --> 20:16.942
That's obviously the wrong saying!

20:16.942 --> 20:18.344
Huh? Really?

20:18.344 --> 20:19.945
Oh, it's "nininbaori," right?

20:19.945 --> 20:21.280
You're way off.

20:21.280 --> 20:23.716
You meant to say "the case is closed," right?

20:23.716 --> 20:25.150
No, that's not it!

20:25.150 --> 20:25.184
It IS it!

20:25.184 --> 20:26.049
It I it!

20:26.652 --> 20:26.752
Maho?

20:26.752 --> 20:27.553
Maho?

20:27.553 --> 20:27.576
Maho?

20:29.421 --> 20:31.150
Miss Serizawa!

20:31.323 --> 20:33.883
You're in there, aren't you?
We're opening the door.

20:38.130 --> 20:39.665
Miss Serizawa?!

20:39.665 --> 20:43.124
This blunder is a disgrace which will
last for generations to come.

20:43.736 --> 20:48.037
I shall commit harakiri and offer an
apology to my father and mother.

20:49.308 --> 20:50.109
No!

20:50.109 --> 20:50.905
Don't!

20:51.543 --> 20:52.704
Now!

21:04.523 --> 21:06.091
All right, I memorized them!

21:06.091 --> 21:07.926
