from the beginning?

21:21.540 --> 21:23.709
Don't make fun of the genius!

21:23.709 --> 21:24.343
Huh?

21:24.343 --> 21:24.743
Huh?

21:24.743 --> 21:29.815
Since I've caused a lot of trouble today,
I'm going to apologize to Becky real quick.

21:29.815 --> 21:30.349
Okay!

21:30.349 --> 21:30.482
Okay!

21:30.482 --> 21:32.184
